{"id":17725,"name":"Kent County","slug":"kent-county","state":"Michigan","code":"MI","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/michigan-tax-deed-sales-property-deals-90-off/kent-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-20T14:50:36","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Deed Sale","typicalSaleDate":"Varies by year; check the county website","bidProcedure":"Premium Bid","deposit":"$1,000 credit card hold","extra":[{"label":"Payment Methods","value":"Wire transfer, check, or card within five days of winning"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Tax-Sale.info"},{"label":"County Website","value":"accessKent.com"},{"label":"Sale Contact","value":"Treasurer’s Office – Kent County, Michigan"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"VBFLIRmnCTpLxfN2lHwEuMivnGXeOAswdKK65kbs1cF9EmGB3yyNp1aUUSjIqxghPdC\"><iframe title=\"Premier Properties at Fractional Prices - Kent County - Michigan Tax Deed Investing\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vQllJji9RnA?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Premier-Properties-at-Fractional-Prices---Kent-County,-Michigan-Tax-Deed-Investing\">Properties at Fractional Prices in Kent County, Michigan</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Looking for a great deal on real estate? Kent County, <a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/michigan-tax-deed-sales-property-deals-90-off/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Michigan&#8217;s</mark></a> tax foreclosure sales might be the opportunity you need. These sales offer properties at significant discounts, ranging from 40% to 90% off their market value. The process is straightforward, with online auctions making it easy to participate from anywhere.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Kent-County-Tax-Deed-Information\">Kent County Tax Deed Information</h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details\">Important Details</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"How-It-Works\">How Kent County Tax Deed Works</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Create an Account:</strong> Sign up on <a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax-Sale.info</mark></a> for free.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Get Authorized:</strong> Place a $1,000 hold on your credit card to be authorized for bidding. This hold is not a charge but will count against your available credit until released.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Advance Bidding:</strong> Start bidding 30 days before the auction. You can modify or delete your bids during this phase.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Active Bidding:</strong> On auction day, from 10 a.m. to 7 p.m., place and adjust your bids based on the current high bid.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Sealed Bid Auctions:</strong> If you missed the initial auction, participate in the second round of sealed bid auctions, during which you submit your best offer without seeing other bids.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Grand-Rapids-Kent-County-Michigan.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Grand-Rapids-Kent-County-Michigan-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Grand-Rapids-Kent-County-Michigan-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Grand-Rapids-Kent-County-Michigan-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Grand-Rapids-Kent-County-Michigan-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Grand-Rapids-Kent-County-Michigan-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Grand-Rapids-Kent-County-Michigan.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Grand-Rapids-Kent-County-Michigan.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Grand-Rapids-Kent-County-Michigan-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Grand-Rapids-Kent-County-Michigan-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Grand-Rapids-Kent-County-Michigan-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Grand-Rapids-Kent-County-Michigan-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Grand-Rapids-Kent-County-Michigan-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-17731 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Grand Rapids, Kent County, Michigan\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Links-for-More-Information\">Links for More Information in Kent County</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.accesskent.com/Departments/Treasurer/auction.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Tax Deed Information</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.accesskent.com/Departments/Treasurer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Treasurer</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Auction Site</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Auction-Process-Overview\">Auction Process Overview in Kent County, MI</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Advance Bidding:</strong> Place and modify bids up to the auction date.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Active Bidding:</strong> Real-time bidding from 10 a.m. to 7 p.m. on auction day.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Second-Round Auctions:</strong> Sealed bids ar</span>e due by a specified date; results will be announced later.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Pro-Tips\">Pro Tips</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research:</strong> Always research the properties before bidding. Visit the property if possible.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Budget Wisely:</strong> Only bid what you can afford, considering that you might win multiple properties.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Understand the Rules:</strong> Familiarize yourself with the auction rules and procedures to avoid surprises.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Frequently-Asked-Questions\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Can-I-get-a-list-of-foreclosed-properties?\">Can I get a list of foreclosed properties?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Yes, the list is typically available around July 1st each year. Kent County uses <a href=\"http://tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Michigan Public Land Auction | Tax-Sale.info</mark></a> to manage the auction process.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"What-happens-if-I-win?\">What happens if I win?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Winners must pay within five days using a wire transfer, check, or card. The sale is final, and the property is deeded to the winning bidder.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Is-there-a-redemption-period?\">Is there a redemption period?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>No, once you purchase the property at the auction, it&#8217;s yours without a redemption period.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Useful-Links\">Useful Links</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Michigan Public Land Auction</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.accesskent.com/Departments/Treasurer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Kent County Treasurer&#8217;s Office</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Need-a-Hand?\">Need a Hand?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>If you have any questions or need further assistance with tax deed investing in Kent County, feel free to reach out to us. Book a call <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">HERE</mark></a>. Happy investing!</p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n<p><em>Sign up or log in to view the full content.</em></p><div id=\"popup-overlay\"></div><div id=\"signup-popup\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\"><h4>Get Instant Free Access To The Training Vault Now</h4><p>Learn how to get 18-36% returns on your investment and buy property for as little as $500 with tax lien and tax deeds.</p><div class=\"video-container\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/FkB-M8RaSHo\" allowfullscreen style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px; height: 315px; border: none; border-radius: 8px;\"></iframe></div><div class=\"button-container\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\"><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Sign Up for FREE Access</button><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Already a Member? Login</button></div></div>","upcomingCount":0}